          {
            "height": 3447,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVu5GHmbUAAppsK.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 4096
          }
        ],
        "name": "Sundar Pichai",
        "text": "I did say we'd be releasing our models periodically...introducing Gemini 4 Carbon, our next frontier model.\n\nFollowing Argon's release just two weeks ago, Carbon shows the pace at which we’re pushing the frontier, it ranks #1 on the recently updated v5.0 of @ArtificialAnlys Intelligence Index at 59. It also leads across key cybersecurity evaluations scoring 88.2% on SEC-bench Pro for finding vulnerabilities, 54.8% on ExploitGym for exploitation, and 71.0% on CWE-bench for patching.\n\nWe’re seeing significant improvements in long-horizon tasks even compared to Argon, and we’ve strengthened frontier safeguards.\n\nAs we did with Argon, we’re going to roll it out gradually + responsibly. Some trusted cyber defenders will get access starting this week. We'll be expanding it to more partners through our Fairwind Program, ahead of wider availability soon, so hang tight!",
        "url": "https://x.com/sundarpichai/status/2115489219804352921",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
